## Recommendation format

When auditing or proposing changes:

```
Current Issue: ...
Why It Matters: ...
Recommended Change: ...
Expected Impact: SEO / Conversion / Trust / Authority
Priority: High / Medium / Low
```

Only recommend changes that are demonstrably better. Do not rewrite merely to be different.

Full audit: `docs/SEO_CRO_AUDIT.md`.
